WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.850
Ken answers Ryu’s Drive Impact with his own.

2
00:00:02.850 --> 00:00:04.650
Ken wins the armor exchange and crumples Ryu.

3
00:00:04.650 --> 00:00:05.150
Ken hits jumping heavy kick during Ryu’s crumple.

4
00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:06.850
Ken lands, then uses raw Drive Rush after the jumping heavy kick.

5
00:00:06.850 --> 00:00:09.100
The Rush heavy-punch extension ends in running Shoryuken.
